\label{properties-lemma-push-sections-supported-on-closed-subset}
\source{stacks:07ZQ}
\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/07ZQ}{\texttt{Stacks tag 07ZQ}}
\group{properties}

Let $f : X \to Y$ be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated morphism
