is an isomorphism, and similarly for $q$. Moreover, the cokernel
of $p^*\Omega_{X/S} \to \Omega_{X \times_S Y/S}$ is
$\Omega_{X \times_S Y/X}$ by
Lemma \ref{morphisms-lemma-triangle-differentials}. The result follows.
\end{proof}

