\begin{proof}
\uses{morphisms-lemma-relative-weak-normalization-algebra, morphisms-proposition-universal-homeomorphism-equal-residue-fields, morphisms-proposition-universal-homeomorphism}

This proof is exactly the same as the proof of
Lemma \ref{morphisms-lemma-relative-weak-normalization-algebra} except we use
