\begin{lemma}[Morphism good diagram proper]
\label{limits-lemma-morphism-good-diagram-proper}
\source{stacks:0CNV}
\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0CNV}{\texttt{Stacks tag 0CNV}}
\group{limits}

\uses{limits-lemma-morphism-good-diagram}
Notation and assumptions as in Lemma \ref{limits-lemma-morphism-good-diagram}.
If $f$ is proper, then there exists an $i_3 \geq i_0$ such that for
